### Register user 1
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "FullName": "John Doe",
    "Email": "johndoe@email.com",
    "Password": "JohnPassword"
}

### Login user 1
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "Email": "johndoe@email.com",
    "Password": "JohnPassword"
}

### Create Post 1 with Logged User
POST http://localhost:5000/api/posts
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..ep1th3FP89i5vhFsjcO3LWlol1Ko7umfK1GZ21kFm5g
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "Title": "Blog ASP.NET Core",
    "Content": "Esse blog está sendo construído utilizando asp.net core, entity framework, identity framework e JWT."
}

### Create Post 2 with Logged User
POST http://localhost:5000/api/posts
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..ep1th3FP89i5vhFsjcO3LWlol1Ko7umfK1GZ21kFm5g
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "Title": "Meu Segundo Post",
    "Content": "Esse aqui é o conteúdo!"
}

### List all user posts
GET http://localhost:5000/api/posts

### List one post by id
GET http://localhost:5000/api/posts/2

### List user posts
GET http://localhost:5000/api/posts/me
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..ep1th3FP89i5vhFsjcO3LWlol1Ko7umfK1GZ21kFm5g

### Update post by id (PUT)
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/posts/1
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..ep1th3FP89i5vhFsjcO3LWlol1Ko7umfK1GZ21kFm5g
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "Title": "Meu Terceiro Post Foi Alterado",
    "Content": "Esse aqui é o conteúdo alterado do meu terceiro post!"
}

### Update post by id (Patch)
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/posts/2
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..ep1th3FP89i5vhFsjcO3LWlol1Ko7umfK1GZ21kFm5g
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "Title": "Title Patch?",
    "Content": "Content Patch?"
}

### Delete post by id
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/posts/2
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..ep1th3FP89i5vhFsjcO3LWlol1Ko7umfK1GZ21kFm5g
